{title: Lagaya Dil}
{artist: Sajjad Ali}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Lagaya [F]dil bahut par dil laga [C]nai,        [C]Lagaya [F]dil bahut par dil laga [C]nai
Tera [Dm]jaisa tere [Am]jaisa [G],        Tere [F]jaisa koi humko mila nai [C]
[C]Lagaya [F]dil bahut par dil laga [C]nai,        Zamaane [Dm]bhar ki baatein
[Am]unse keh [C]di,        Zamaane [Dm]bhar ki baatein
[Am]unse keh [G]di,        Jo kehna [F]chahiye tha wo kaha [C]nai
Jo kehna [F]chahiye tha wo kaha [C]nai,        [F]Lagaya dil bahut par dil laga [C]nai
Woh sach mein [Dm]pyar tha ya,        [Am]bachpana [C]tha
Woh sach mein [Dm]pyar tha ya,        [Am]bachpana [G]tha
[F]Mohabbat ho gayi thi kya pata [C]nai,        Moha [F]bbat ho gayi thi kya pata [C]nai
Lagaya [F]dil bahut par,        Woh mujhko [Dm]lag raha tha
[Am]pyar [C]mera,        Woh mujhko [Dm]lag raha tha
[Am]pyar [G]mera,        Wo jaisa [F]lag raha tha waisa tha [C]nai
Woh jaisa [F]lag raha tha waisa tha [C]nai,        Lagaya [F]dil bahut par dil laga [C]nai
Naa roya [Dm]tha bichhadne,        [Am]par main [C]unke
Naa roya [Dm]tha bichhadne,        [Am]par main [G]unke
Magar [F]haan zindagi me phir hansa [C]nai
Magar [F]haan zindagi me phir hansa [C]nai,        Lagaya [F]dil bahut par [C]hmmm
Ye tohfe [Dm]hai jo apno [Am]se mile [C]hai,        Ye tohfe [Dm]hai jo apno [Am]se mile [G]hai
Humein [F]ghairon se koi bhi gila [C]nai,        Humein [F]ghairon se koi bhi gila [C]nai
Tere [Dm]jaisa.. tere [Am]jaisa [G],        Tere [F]jaisa koi humko mila [C]nai
Lagaya [F]dil bahut par dil [C]laga nai
